# Project architecture

Canonical docs:
- `.agents/rules/architecture.md`
- `.agents/skills/fidenza-architecture/SKILL.md`
- `.agents/README.md` (how `.agents` + `.cursor` work together)

## Place code correctly

- `config/` — site info, navigation, social
- `app/` — thin routes only
- `layout/` — Header, Footer, SiteShell
- `features/<area>/` — domain modules:
  - `sections/` — page sections
  - `components/` — feature forms/widgets (keep sections thin)
  - `config/` — copy
  - `consts/` — enums, options, limits
  - `types/` — TS types
  - `schema/` — Zod + defaultValues
  - `utils/` — feature helpers
- `components/` — shared UI
- `components/ui/` — shadcn CLI only
- `providers/` — Lenis, theme, toaster
- `lib/` — app-wide utils (`cn`)

## Hard rules

- **English feature folders** — `features/<area>/` in English (`success-cases`, not `casos-exito`). Spanish OK only for public routes (`/casos-de-exito`) and user copy.
- **No god files** — never dump schema + consts + utils + copy + UI in one file. Split by concern.
- Split inside `features/<area>/`: `consts/` · `utils/` · `schema/` · `types/` · `config/` · `components/` · `sections/` (sections stay thin).
- Nav/contact/social from `@/config` — never hardcode in header/footer.
- Pages compose `@/layout` + `@/features/*` — no large sections in `app/page.tsx`.
- No page sections in root `components/`.
- Forms in `features/<area>/components/`; sections only compose.
- Do not hand-grow `components/ui/`.
- Brand tokens from `app/globals.css`.
- Icons: Hugeicons via `@/components/icon`; Lucide only in shadcn UI.
